WEBVTT

NOTE
This part has no narration. These captions describe what happens on screen.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
[No narration] The orizons.xyz home page. The buyer connects a Freighter wallet.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
[The console opens on its Overview.]

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.000
[The Agent Registry.]

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.000
[In the Orchestrator, the buyer types what they want: a snake game.]

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
[An execution plan appears: six paid agent steps, each with its price, and a total.
The buyer authorizes it, and Freighter signs and confirms.]

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
[The agents' steps run, each with its progress.]

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
[The Trace page's event log.]

00:00:33.000 --> 00:01:00.000
[The delivered snake game, previewed in the console and played to "New High Score".]

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.000
[The game's code.]

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.837
[Back to the game's preview.]
